# There is nothing to copy or fill in here.
#
# To run genzen on this machine:
#
#   1. Install Docker (it runs Postgres and the image bucket for you).
#   2. pnpm local:up   -- asks for FAL_KEY. Anthropic is optional; without it
#                         the AI text features are off and everything else works.
#   3. pnpm dev
#
# local:up writes .env.local itself. Every variable the app reads, and what a
# deployment sets each one to, is the Variables table in docs/deploying.md.
